From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuxuan Shui <yshui@codeweavers.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Feb 2026 19:58:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: When overriding dlls, update len.

Otherwise build_import_name will access OOB when reading the dll name.

CW-Bug-Id: #24534
(cherry picked from commit 7c37252819efe894a313eb1ffd4bad4c42519479)
---
 dlls/ntdll/loader.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
index e959a16cf5d..fb4a1fca73a 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -1196,6 +1196,7 @@ static BOOL import_dll( WINE_MODREF *wm, const IMAGE_IMPORT_DESCRIPTOR *descr, L
         {
             TRACE("%s -> ntdll.\n", name);
             name = "ntdll.dll";
+            len = strlen(name);
         }
     }
 
